+**Outputs:** A closed, oriented 2-manifold mesh representing the isosurface [S1].
 
 **Data Structures:**
 *   **Binary Picture $I$:** A 3D grid of voxels. The source assumes the border of the support contains only 0-voxels or only 1-voxels [S1].
